{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "sales.complete_sale payload",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": [
    "items"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "items": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "product_name",
          "price",
          "quantity"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "product_id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "product_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "product_sku": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "is_service": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "quantity": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "price": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "discount": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "tax_category_key": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "tax_rate": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "tax_class_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "is_gift": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "gift_reason": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "cost": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "category_id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "unit_code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "unit_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "factor_num": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "factor_den": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "increment_value": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "price_quantity_value": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "pricing_unit_code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "pricing_unit_name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "pricing_factor_num": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "pricing_factor_den": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tax_included": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "discount_percent": {
      "type": "number"
    },
    "amount_tendered": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "payment_method_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "payment_method_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "customer_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "customer_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "channel": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "source_module": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "status": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "order_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "order_number": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "staff_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "staff_name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "appointment_id": {
      "type": [
        "string",
        "null"
      ]
    },
    "customer_tax_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "NIF/CIF del cliente asignado (snapshot fiscal, ADR-0132). Vacío = venta anónima."
    },
    "customer_address": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Dirección fiscal del cliente en una línea (snapshot, ADR-0132)."
    },
    "document_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "ticket",
        "invoice"
      ],
      "description": "Tipo de documento fiscal (ADR-0140): 'ticket' = factura simplificada (→ F2), 'invoice' = factura completa (→ F1). Se fija atómicamente al completar la venta y viaja en `sale.completed`; por defecto 'ticket'. Reemplaza al comando retro `sales.set_document_type`."
    }
  },
  "description": "DINERO (`price`, `amount_tendered`) = UNIDADES MÍNIMAS enteras (ADR-0007/0123): un 2.20 aquí serían 2 céntimos. `quantity` = PUNTO FIJO entero, escala global 10⁶ (ADR-0147): 0,5 kg es 500000 — nunca un float. `price` es «por price_quantity_value de pricing_unit_code» (KPEIN §2.3; por defecto, por 1 unidad). El contexto de unidades (unit_code, factor num/den, increment_value, pricing_*) se CONGELA en la línea (§2.4). Fuera de la rejilla del incremento el comando se RECHAZA (§2.2). Las TASAS (`discount`, `tax_rate`) sí llevan decimales; el `tax_rate` del cliente es una PISTA: el servidor resuelve el % real desde `tax_category_key` (ADR-0085/0069)."
}
